            "heading": "How long is delivery?",
            "row_content": "<p>Most orders are delivered and installed within five working days. We confirm a slot by phone once the order is placed.</p>",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you deliver to every part of Singapore?",
